{"id":"1f2a6a2e1de8a327","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/000_ZFC/规范公式/ZFC_PolyCheckerCorrect.md","title":"PolyCheckerCorrect","display":"PolyCheckerCorrect","type":"system","metadata":{"tags":["ZFC","normative-formula"],"macro_name":"PolyCheckerCorrect","parameters":[],"formula_kind":"proof_obligation_formula"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"tags","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>ZFC</span><span>normative-formula</span></div>"},{"key":"macro_name","html":"PolyCheckerCorrect"},{"key":"parameters","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"formula_kind","html":"proof_obligation_formula"}],"html":"\n<p>定义组：接口端点。有序参数：无（闭公式）。</p>\n<p>待以内核证明的显式 System F 检查器对应命题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范公式\">规范公式</h2>\n<p><code>(@ PolyCheckerCorrect)</code> 按 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f625c6fc1945e22e\" href=\"?note=f625c6fc1945e22e\" title=\"000_ZFC/01_language\">无捕获缩写规则</a> 展开为下列有限公式。参数只取集合，不能填入函数项或元语言公式。</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-zfc\">(forall d (forall g (forall t (forall a (iff (@ PolyAccept d g t a) (@ PolyType d g t a))))))\n</code></pre>\n<h2 id=\"直接依赖\">直接依赖</h2>\n<p><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"906d5282a041cf8e\" href=\"?note=906d5282a041cf8e\" title=\"ZFC_PolyAccept\">PolyAccept</a>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"de2d60bf72fd6cc5\" href=\"?note=de2d60bf72fd6cc5\" title=\"ZFC_PolyType\">PolyType</a></p>\n<h2 id=\"证明状态\">证明状态</h2>\n<p>这是待证明命题的陈述，不是一个已证明定理，也不加入公理集。 语言闭包检查与数学正确性验收的区别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"593f9bdab4d60707\" href=\"?note=593f9bdab4d60707\" title=\"000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务\">000_ZFC/13_元理论核对与证明义务</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"规范公式","text":"规范公式","level":2},{"id":"直接依赖","text":"直接依赖","level":2},{"id":"证明状态","text":"证明状态","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"000_ZFC/01_language","status":"resolved","id":"f625c6fc1945e22e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"规范公式","excerpt":"`(@ PolyCheckerCorrect)` 按 